rs deep against one safety: advance it fast, then score or get the foul."}]},{"id":"rest-o-hbs","section":"offense","title":"High ball screen","caption":"Hedge hard. Anticipate the roll from the help side.","frames":[{"offense":[{"id":"O1","pos":{"x":25,"y":38}},{"id":"O2","pos":{"x":46,"y":5}},{"id":"O3","pos":{"x":4,"y":5}},{"id":"O4","pos":{"x":43,"y":23}},{"id":"O5","pos":{"x":29,"y":31}}],"defense":[],"ballHolder":"O1","lines":[{"id":"rest12","type":"screen","color":"offense","points":[{"x":29,"y":31},{"x":22,"y":33}]},{"id":"rest13","type":"dribble","color":"offense","points":[{"x":25,"y":38},{"x":18,"y":32},{"x":14,"y":25}]}],"note":"High ball screen, usually set by the big. Shooters sit in both corners and the opposite wing."},{"offense":[{"id":"O1","pos":{"x":14,"y":25}},{"id":"O2","pos":{"x":46,"y":5}},{"id":"O3","pos":{"x":4,"y":5}},{"id":"O4","pos":{"x":43,"y":23}},{"id":"O5","pos":{"x":22,"y":33}}],"defense":[],"ballHolder":"O1","lines":[{"id":"rest14","type":"cut","color":"offense","points":[{"x":22,"y":33},{"x":26,"y":18},{"x":25,"y":9}]},{"id":"rest15","type":"pass","color":"offense","points":[{"x":14,"y":25},{"x":43,"y":23}]}],"note":"Off the screen they shoot the 3, penetrate, or kick to the opposite wing. The big rolls to the rim."}]},{"id":"rest-b-line","section":"blob_offense","title":"Line (our Stack play)","caption":"","frames":[{"offense":[{"id":"O1","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":-1.4}},{"id":"O2","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":8.5}},{"id":"O3","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":11.5}},{"id":"O4","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":14.5}},{"id":"O5","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":17.5}}],"defense":[],"ballHolder":"O1","lines":[{"id":"rest16","type":"cut","color":"offense","points":[{"x":31.5,"y":17.5},{"x":25,"y":27}]},{"id":"rest17","type":"pass","color":"offense","points":[{"x":31.5,"y":-1.4},{"x":25,"y":27}]}],"note":"Four players stacked in a line on the ball-side lane. The last one in line flashes to the top of the key."},{"offense":[{"id":"O1","pos":{"x":31.5,"y":-1.4}},{"id":"O2","pos":{"x":31.5,"